/**
 * Real Scryfall card and set objects, trimmed to the fields
 * app/utils/scryfall.server.ts reads, taken from the default_cards bulk file
 * of 2026-09-29. Seed them with insertMtgCards() (tests/mtg-db.ts), which runs
 * them through the sync's own mapping.
 *
 * What's here: the five basics; commanders (Atraxa, Krenko, Kenrith) and
 * partners (Thrasios, Tymna); a companion (Lurrus); a transform card
 * (Delver), a modal DFC (Emeria's Call), a split card (Fire // Ice) and an
 * adventure (Bonecrusher Giant); cards banned in Commander (Dockside
 * Extortionist, Jeweled Lotus); game changers (Rhystic Study, Cyclonic Rift,
 * Gaea's Cradle, which is also on the Reserved List); two printings of Sol Ring
 * (one etched-only); staples; a planeswalker; a token (Treasure); and a
 * reversible card (no top-level oracle_id).
 */
